{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "New Paths"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Just Blurt it Out"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contents."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le01ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Future"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You can use four different tenses to talk about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you talk about a things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "With will you use words like: <span class=\"italic\">perhaps, maybe </span> and  <span class=\"italic\">I think</span>, to show you are still not sure."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you ask about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span>. With going to you often use works like: <span class=\"italic\">sometime, soon</span> and <span class=\"italic\">when I have time</span>, to show you intend to do this, but have not set a specific time."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you  talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the Present Continuous tense. <br>With the Present Continuous, you use specific times and dates to show this event is booked."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Many people use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span> in place of the Present Continuous tense. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the Simple Present tense to talk about future schedules. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We'll wash up later.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Going to</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I'm going to cook him dinner to surprise him!</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He's coming here next week!</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Present </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The movie starts at 8 p.m.</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Personal Qualities and Behavior"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " When you talk about family, you often describe their personalities and their behavior."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Their personality is their general character. They way they are. <br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Sandra is a tidy person. Her apartment is always clean and neat.</span> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Their behavior is the way they act or conduct themselves. <br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Tom is usually relaxed but today he seems nervous.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We use adjectives to talk about behavior and personality."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":10,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Synonym\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"fierce\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"relentless; fierce\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"optimistic\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hopeful;confident\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"demanding\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"exacting; tough\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"conservative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"traditional; unprogressive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"stubborn\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"inflexible; single-minded\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"energetic\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"active; lively\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ambitious\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"determined; eager\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"adventurous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bold; daring\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"enthusiastic\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"keen; passionate\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to clean"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to tidy and do housework "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have to clean before my family arrives! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you have to review."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "demanding"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "expecting a lot of effort or work  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Our manager is very demanding. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to grill "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to question relentlessly "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: His father will grill you if you go there for dinner."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "enthusiastic"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "being eager and excited  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He's enthusiastic about his new job."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "optimistic"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "hopeful and confident  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They are optimistic about the future of the company. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "asset "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something useful or valuable  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She is an asset to the firm. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob11aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fierce"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "aggressive  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I heard that the new editor is fierce!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob11aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write about what a friend or family member always,usually, sometimes, hardly ever and never does."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Mention where your friend or family member goes and what he or she does."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say if you do this with them or not."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 75-90 words in a paragraph."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your paragraph to a partne